ai "Thumper"
about "Downhill against the run, arrives with bad intentions."
position LB
dials aggression 0.85 discipline 0.5 vision 0.55

rules:
  when they run -> fill the gap; hit hard
  when engaged and carrier within 3 -> shed the block
  when carrier within 2 -> hit hard
  when ball in air and ball coming my way -> play the ball
  otherwise -> follow assignment
